<section class="page-hero shell compact"><span class="kicker">POSTVENTA</span><h1>Tu coche, <em>siempre a punto.</em></h1><p>Solicita mantenimiento y consulta cada etapa desde la recogida hasta la entrega del vehículo.</p></section><section class="section shell two-col"><div class="surface"><h2>Solicitar asistencia</h2><p class="muted">Registra una incidencia y el personal de la demo podrá actualizar su estado.</p><?php if (!current_user()): ?><div class="empty-state small"><p>Inicia sesión como cliente para enviar una solicitud.</p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/acceder">Iniciar sesión ↗</a></div><?php elseif (current_user()['role'] !== 'customer'): ?><p class="muted">Este formulario es exclusivo para clientes.</p><?php else: ?><form action="/taller" method="post" class="stack-form"><?= csrf_field() ?><div class="form-grid"><label>Marca<input type="text" name="make" minlength="2" maxlength="80" required placeholder="Ej. SEAT"></label><label>Modelo<input type="text" name="model" maxlength="80" required placeholder="Ej. León"></label></div><label>Matrícula<input type="text" name="plate" minlength="4" maxlength="20" required placeholder="1234 ABC"></label><label>Dirección de recogida<input type="text" name="address" minlength="8" maxlength="255" required placeholder="Calle, número, ciudad..."></label><label>Describe la incidencia<textarea name="description" rows="5" minlength="10" maxlength="3000" required placeholder="¿Qué le ocurre a tu vehículo?"></textarea></label><button class="btn btn-primary" type="submit">Enviar solicitud ↗</button></form><?php endif; ?></div><div><div class="surface"><span class="card-overline">CÓMO FUNCIONA</span><h2>De principio a fin.</h2><div class="timeline"><?php foreach (\App\Models\Repair::STATES as $state => $label): ?><div class="timeline-item"><span class="timeline-symbol">○</span><div><strong><?= e($label) ?></strong></div></div><?php endforeach; ?></div></div></div></section><?php if (current_user() && current_user()['role'] === 'customer'): ?><section class="section shell"><div class="section-heading"><h2>Mis solicitudes</h2><span><?= count($repairs) ?> solicitudes</span></div><?php if (!$repairs): ?><div class="empty-state surface"><p>No has registrado solicitudes de taller.</p></div><?php else: ?><div class="order-grid"><?php foreach ($repairs as $repair): ?><article class="surface"><div class="order-top"><span class="card-overline">TALLER #<?= (int) $repair['id'] ?></span><span class="pill"><?= e(\App\Models\Repair::STATES[$repair['status']] ?? $repair['status']) ?></span></div><h3><?= e($repair['make']) ?> <?= e($repair['model']) ?></h3><p><?= e($repair['license_plate']) ?> · <?= date_es($repair['created_at']) ?></p><p><?= e($repair['description']) ?></p></article><?php endforeach; ?></div><?php endif; ?></section><?php endif; ?>